#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyh743.rst:41
#: b89cda10c0a742b1bb9d9a067df644c8
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyh743.rst:42
#: 7795998d23f742248c484992f5359bf4
msgid ""
"The default RC input is configured on the UART2_RX inverted from the SBUS "
"pin.  All unidirectional ArduPilot compatible protocols, except PPM, are "
"supported. Receivers using bi-directional protocols such as CRSF/ELRS should"
" be tied to the TX2 and RX2 pins."
msgstr ""
"默认RC输入配置在UART2_RX，从SBUS引脚反相输入。支持除PPM以外的所有单向ArduPilot兼容协议。使用双向协议（如CRSF/ELRS）的接收机应连接至TX2和RX2引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyh743.rst:44
#: 8467e36753bb4cda903bc4d681026822
msgid ""
"FPort requires connection to TX2 . See :ref:`FPort Receivers<common-Fport-"
"receivers>`."
msgstr "FPort需连接TX2。参见 :ref:`FPort接收机<common-Fport-receivers>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyh743.rst:45
#: 56b46f60c5aa400089756bb5703651ed
msgid ""
"CRSF/ELRS also requires a TX2 connection, in addition to RX2, and "
"automatically provides telemetry."
msgstr "CRSF/ELRS除需连接RX2外，还需连接TX2，并自动提供数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyh743.rst:46
#: 74ccd5cc2a1841bfb0a43ca8a4852456
msgid ""
"SRXL2 requires a connection to TX2 and automatically provides telemetry. Set"
" :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` to “4”."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2需连接TX2，并自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「4」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyh743.rst:49
#: 9382d5c810544831ac863904921cee04
msgid "FrSky Telemetry"
msgstr "FrSky数传"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyh743.rst:50
#: 599744496f5643df839c1dedbd19ab6f
msgid ""
"FrSky Telemetry can be supported using any UART. For example, the T4 pin "
"(UART4 transmit). You need to set the following parameters to enable support"
" for FrSky S.PORT"
msgstr "FrSky数传可通过任意UART实现，例如T4引脚（UART4发送）。需设置以下参数以启用FrSky S.PORT支持："

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyh743.rst:52
#: e916d44785ef4134bc0399b16279e240
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL<SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` 10"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL<SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` 10"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyh743.rst:53
#: d35f39f60b1f42778a119fd5b127cbac
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` 7"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` 7"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyh743.rst:56
#: 477a938de88e4aae85a5115c8e8ab5a4
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyh743.rst:57
#: f1126bbc968b4f6584210edad8754ca4
msgid ""
"The BROTHERHOBBYH743 supports using its internal OSD (MAX7456 driver). "
"Simultaneous DisplayPort OSD operation  is also pre-configured on SERIAL 6. "
"See :ref:`common-msp-osd-overview-4.2` for more info."
msgstr ""
"BROTHERHOBBYH743 支持使用内置OSD（MAX7456驱动）。同时在SERIAL 6上预配置了DisplayPort "
"OSD同步操作。更多信息请参阅 :ref:`common-msp-osd-overview-4.2`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyh743.rst:60
#: 3a112f82812c4d528708e203b5b3f6cf
msgid "VTX Support"
msgstr "图传支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyh743.rst:61
#: 6c2ffec518b543e3a68cce226aa98a7e
msgid ""
"The SH1.0-6P connector supports a standard DJI HD VTX connection. Pin 1 of "
"the connector is 12v so be careful not to connect to devices that cannot "
"accept that voltage."
msgstr "SH1.0-6P接口支持标准DJI HD图传连接。接口第1针为12V，请勿连接不能承受该电压的设备。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyh743.rst:64
#: b2496b0889e24ea9a0dac1f16bbc5991
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyh743.rst:65
#: 652d8c1e43e048758609efb52d672b94
msgid ""
"The BROTHERHOBBYH743 supports up to 13 PWM outputs. All outputs except 11/12"
" support DShot. Outputs 1-8 support bi-directional DShot."
msgstr "BROTHERHOBBYH743 最多支持13路PWM输出。除输出11/12外，所有输出均支持DShot。输出1-8支持双向DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyh743.rst:67
#: 14a77ed7e3204f9d82e1757b24ac5a15
msgid ""
"PWM outputs are grouped and every group must use the same output protocol:"
msgstr "PWM输出分组，每组必须使用相同的输出协议："

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyh743.rst:69
#: 87d9b4b3bcbc44cba211c9535a2f86c3
msgid "PWM 1-2   in group1"
msgstr "PWM 1-2 在第1组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyh743.rst:70
#: 324c2e14fd2147cb908dba2357cfab37
msgid "PWM 3-4   in group2"
msgstr "PWM 3-4 在第2组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyh743.rst:71
#: cc24bc9ae5034e31a5435fcf33007a86
msgid "PWM 5-6   in group3"
msgstr "PWM 5-6 在第3组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyh743.rst:72
#: 37793aa705b04571b4863315b3c89912
msgid "PWM 7-10  in group4"
msgstr "PWM 7-10 在第4组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyh743.rst:73
#: 51225933ea37462e83e3fa46c11f0ef6
msgid "PWM 11-12 in group5"
msgstr "PWM 11-12 在第5组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyh743.rst:74
#: 2a1264420a6a46858a102b3f0db8eba1
msgid "PWM 13    in group6 - LED strip"
msgstr "PWM 13 在第6组 - LED灯条"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyh743.rst:77
#: ab9650f868004d2599115ed823da173a
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr "电池监测"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyh743.rst:78
#: 7b0a1070604c4f62a8e1f26ad3ba5e2e
msgid ""
"The board has a internal voltage sensor and connections on the ESC connector"
" for an external current sensor input. The voltage sensor can handle up to "
"6S LiPo batteries."
msgstr "该板内置电压传感器，并在ESC接口上提供外部电流传感器输入接口。电压传感器最高支持6S LiPo电池。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyh743.rst:80
#: f439f7af945145cb9706da7280d7461a
msgid "The default battery parameters are:"
msgstr "默认电池参数为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyh743.rst:82
#: 9b244ef24bef43e4b79aa526b6db5e33
msgid ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR <BATT_MONITOR>` = 4"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR <BATT_MONITOR>` = 4"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyh743.rst:83
#: 21c939bf9ca641c39840bda6fb7680a6
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN <BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 10"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN <BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 10"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyh743.rst:84
#: bff9638e1a204d86bb2de57300ec9dbc
msgid ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN <BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN <BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyh743.rst:85
#: 717a4b17111247909e29e37cb301e099
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT <BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT <BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11"

