#: bc364deea5d54a0db4a06aacb15c53dd
msgid ":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT <BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 40.2"
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT <BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 40.2"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyh743.rst:89
#: b482ef3fa5cf4a5e9b1391276c5ae75c
msgid "RSSI"
msgstr "RSSI"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyh743.rst:90
#: 882b4e6470644086add4d549c01b5add
msgid "ADC Pin 8 -> RSSI voltage monitoring"
msgstr "ADC引脚8 -> RSSI电压监测"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyh743.rst:93
#: b9543cebb5d84c7794a5fae716143fb4
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyh743.rst:94
#: a97be2359817452fafd8d636bd0e2b3f
msgid ""
"The BROTHERHOBBYH743 does not have a built-in compass, but you can attach an"
" external compass using I2C on the SDA and SCL connector."
msgstr "BROTHERHOBBYH743 无内置罗盘，但可通过SDA和SCL接口使用I2C连接外部罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyh743.rst:97
#: 61e41359aa11491aa52416d6f3c2b3f8
msgid "VTX power control"
msgstr "图传电源控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyh743.rst:98
#: eab90fe6c7014787b1900f75d764596b
msgid ""
"GPIO 81 controls the VTX BEC output to pins marked \"10V\". Setting this "
"GPIO low removes voltage supply to pins. By default RELAY2 is configured to "
"control this pin and sets the GPIO high."
msgstr ""
"GPIO 81 控制标注为 「10V」 "
"引脚的图传BEC输出。将该GPIO拉低可切断引脚供电。默认情况下，RELAY2已配置为控制此引脚并将GPIO置高。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyh743.rst:101
#: 4b9189e8c9064e14b31e6b2083323fff
msgid "Camera control"
msgstr "摄像头控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyh743.rst:102
#: 47dcdde07f244f66800a7c656dbfdabf
msgid ""
"GPIO 82 controls the camera output to the connectors marked \"CAM1\" and "
"\"CAM2\". Setting this GPIO high switches the video output from CAM1 to "
"CAM2. By default RELAY3 is configured to control this pin and sets the GPIO "
"low."
msgstr ""
"GPIO 82 控制标注为 「CAM1」 和 「CAM2」 "
"接口的摄像头输出。将该GPIO拉高可将视频输出从CAM1切换至CAM2。默认情况下，RELAY3已配置为控制此引脚并将GPIO置低。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyh743.rst:105
#: 7f3c1a9e820148e0bd8cf9987b5bd7fc
msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr "加载固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyh743.rst:106
#: b0b02099b17c43c4a861d7ed7ef02642
msgid ""
"Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the "
"bootloader button pressed. Then you should load the \"with_bl.hex\" "
"firmware, using your favorite DFU loading tool."
msgstr "首次固件加载可通过DFU完成：按住引导程序按钮并插入USB。然后使用您常用的DFU工具加载 「with_bl.hex」 固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyh743.rst:108
#: 91b06a09bd224deaa36b185ecc0af486
msgid ""
"Once the initial firmware is loaded you can update the firmware using any "
"ArduPilot ground station software. Updates should be done with the "
"\"\\*.apj\" firmware files."
msgstr "初始固件加载完成后，可使用任意ArduPilot地面站软件更新固件。更新请使用 「\\*.apj」 固件文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyh743.rst:110
#: 1528f48bf17b4087ad03c04644607224
msgid ""
"Firmware for these boards can be found at https://firmware.ardupilot.org in "
"sub-folders labeled \"BROTHEHOBBYH743\"."
msgstr "这些板的固件可在 https://firmware.ardupilot.org 的 「BROTHEHOBBYH743」 子文件夹中找到。"
